        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I honestly think about that kind of changes as Incremental improvement of software - design goals can be the same if we add reasonable change to Neovim specific group, as this plugin is Neovim only. I also think that few changes like that will not make mini.base16 be similar to mini.hues. But I respect your opinion.\n\nFloatTitle is by far the only think that I do not like about the plugin - good job anyway and good luck!",
